    {
      "flavor_text": "By extending its rolled-up ears\nand striking the ground, it can\nbound so high it surprises itself.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　まるめている　みみを\nいきおいよく　のばすと　おおきな\nいわも　かんたんに　こわせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "항상 말고 있는 귀를\n힘껏 늘리면 커다란\n바위도 간단히 부순다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses oreilles repliées se déroulent avec une force\ncapable de briser un gros rocher.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Ohren sind immer aufgerollt. Mit ihnen kann\nes selbst große Felsbrocken zertrümmern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lleva las orejas enrolladas. Cuando las extiende,\ngolpea con tal fuerza que incluso puede romper rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue orecchie sono sempre arrotolate. Può\nestenderle con forza per distruggere qualsiasi cosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully\nextended to shatter even a large boulder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　まるめている　耳を\n勢いよく　伸ばすと　大きな\n岩も　簡単に　壊せる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lleva las orejas enrolladas. Cuando las extiende,\ngolpea con tal fuerza que incluso puede romper rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんを　かんじとると　りょうみみを\nたてて　けいかいする。さむい　よるは\nけがわに　かおを　うずめて　ねむる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위험을 느끼면 양쪽 귀를\n세워서 경계한다. 추운 밤에는\n털에 얼굴을 묻고 잠잔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dresse les oreilles quand il sent un danger.\nIl dort la tête dans sa fourrure pendant les nuits\nfroides.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nimmt es Gefahr wahr, richtet es seine Ohren auf.\nIn kalten Nächten vergräbt es den Kopf in seinem Fell.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando siente peligro, levanta las orejas. En noches\nfrías, duerme con la cabeza metida en el pelaje.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Drizza le orecchie quando avverte un pericolo. Nelle\nnotti fredde, dorme con la testa nella pelliccia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
